<title>THAILAND: Noble Develop debuts at 11.50 baht.</title>
<headline>Noble Develop debuts at 11.50 baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer Noble Development Plc debuted on the Thai stock exchange at 11.50 baht against its IPO price of 16 baht.</p>
<p>At 0306 GMT, the stock slipped to 11.00 baht in a thin market. It ranked second on the active list.  </p>
<p>Noble Development is a property developing firm. It has several housing projects in Bangkok and neighbouring provinces.</p>
<p>Brokers said they did not expect Noble Development's stock price to move higher than its IPO price due to the current weakness of the market.</p>
<p>At 0317 GMT the stock eased further to 10.75 baht.</p>
</text>
